A: How do you tell a friend to get something done in Russian, or not to do it?
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Скажи́, (@draw known@) повтори́: you can already ask a friend (@draw today@) for those. Today: done, doing, or don't.

    erase known today

A: Tom has spent the afternoon at Masha's. Now he's off home. Listen.
    draw house

A: Ма́ша, я иду́ домо́й. Пока́!
    draw balloon_t caption false

    draw balloon

    ask "What two things does she ask?" voice b options ["phone her and read the book","read the book and write to her","write to her and watch a film"] correct 2
        gloss: Read the book and write to me!
        listen: Прочита́й кни́гу и напиши́ мне!
        right: Read the book, and write to her.
        wrong: Listen for прочита́й and напиши́: you know прочита́л and написа́л.

    erase house balloon balloon_t

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

B: Прочита́й кни́гу и напиши́ мне!
    draw s1

A: Two requests to a friend, like повтори́. And they're made from last lesson's (@draw d1@) done verbs, in the ты form: (@draw d2@) прочита́ешь, напи́шешь.

A: Drop the ешь. After a vowel, add й: прочита́ешь, прочита́й.
    highlight d1 color #3d8a5a part й$

A: After a consonant, add и, as in повтори́: напи́шешь, напиши́.
    highlight d2 color #3a6fb0 part и$

A: And for вы, add те: прочита́йте, напиши́те.
    draw vy

    erase s1 d1 d2 vy

A: Every (@draw h_doing h_done i1 c1a c1b@) pair of verbs gives two requests: чита́й (@draw i2 c2a c2b@) and прочита́й, пиши́ and напиши́.

    draw ex1

A: The done one asks for one job, done to the end: прочита́й кни́гу, the whole book.
    highlight c1b color #c9871a effect underline

    draw ex2

A: The doing one says get on with it, or keep at it: чита́й! Go on, read.
    highlight c1a color #c9871a effect underline

    erase ex1 ex2

A: And звони́ть has a done verb too: позвони́ть, with по. Позвони́ мне! Call me, once.
    draw i3 c3a c3b

    quiz "A friend stops reading at page ten. Tell him: go on, read! Pick one." store chk voice b
        right: Чита́й: keep at it, so the doing verb.
        wrong: He should keep going, not finish one job: the doing verb.
        * Прочита́й!
        + Чита́й!

    hide board

A: Now (@draw win@) the other way: don't. Не, and nearly always the doing verb. (@draw otk@) Открыва́ть is to open.

B: Не открыва́й окно́! Хо́лодно.
    draw neg1 cold

    erase win neg1 cold otk

A: One (@draw bookf@) exception: a warning against an accident takes the done (@draw zab@) verb. Забы́ть is to forget.

B: Не забу́дь кни́гу!
    draw neg2

A: Не забу́дь, don't forget: you never forget on purpose.
    highlight neg2 color #c9871a part забу́дь effect underline

A: And забу́дь breaks the и rule: it ends in ь. Learn it as it is.
    draw odd

    erase bookf neg2 zab odd

A: To (@draw dp@) suggest something together: пойдём, in дава́й (@draw film@) пойдём, is a done verb's мы form. Other done verbs fit there too.

B: (@draw dv1@) Дава́й посмо́трим фильм! (@draw dv2@) Дава́й напи́шем ма́ме!

    erase dp film dv1 dv2

    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Now the whole goodbye at Masha's door. Listen, then practise it.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Приходи́, come over, is a doing verb: asking someone over takes the doing one. Дава́й with мы takes the done one.
    highlight talk_5_words color #c9871a part приходи effect underline

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw q_phone

    quiz "Ask a friend to phone you tonight, once: ___ мне ве́чером! Which fits?" reveal.text "Позвони мне ве́чером!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Позвони́: one call, so the done verb.
        wrong: One call, done: the done verb, with по.
        + Позвони
        * Звони
        * Позвоню́

    erase q_phone

    draw q_win

    quiz "Tell a friend not to open the window. Pick one." reveal.text "Не открыва́й окно́!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Не открыва́й: не, and the doing verb.
        wrong: Don't is не, and a request ending in й.
        * Не открыва́ю окно́.
        * Открыва́й окно́!
        + Не открыва́й окно́!

    erase q_win

    draw q_film

    quiz "Suggest to a friend: let's watch the film. Pick one." reveal.text "Дава́й посмо́трим фильм!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Дава́й посмо́трим: дава́й and the done verb's мы form, like пойдём.
        wrong: After дава́й comes the мы form, as in дава́й пойдём.
        + Дава́й посмо́трим фильм!
        * Дава́й посмотрю́ фильм!
        * Дава́й посмотре́л фильм!

    erase q_film

    draw q_book

    ask "A friend is leaving your place without his book. Warn him." say_it "Не забу́дь кни́гу!" gloss "Don't forget the book!" voice b show cue test t1

B: Не забу́дь кни́гу!
    draw q_say

    erase q_book q_say

    draw q_build q_build2

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type, to a friend: Read the book and phone me!" answer ["прочитай книгу и позвони мне"] reveal.text "Прочита́й кни́гу и позвони мне" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Прочита́й кни́гу и позвони́ мне: two jobs, each done once, so two done verbs.
        wrong: Two jobs to finish, so two done verbs: Прочита́й кни́гу и позвони́ мне.

    erase q_build q_build2

    draw score_woman

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase score_woman

    show board

    text sum_b "не забу́дь" #3d3833 say "не забу́дь" x 730 y 225 font_size 36

A: So the done verb for one job, to the end, and for a warning: прочита́й, позвони́, не забу́дь.
    highlight c1b c2b c3b sum_b color #c9871a effect underline

    draw sum_a

A: The doing verb to keep at it, to ask someone over, and with не: чита́й, приходи́, не открыва́й.
    highlight c1a c2a c3a sum_a color #c9871a effect underline

    erase board sum_a sum_b

B: Позвони́ мне! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    text end_say "Позвони мне! Пока́!" say "Позвони́ мне! Пока́!" say_voice b x 500 y 300 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_say

A: Next time: я до́лжен, I must.
    box next67 "Next: lesson 67 · я до́лжен" say "я до́лжен" x 500 y 430 width 640 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

